//! The one walk of the title bar, the dispatch sheet, the notes layer and the merge strip with the
//! Job marks, played in that order on a stage that holds all of them. The four walks it condenses
//! stay as they are (`title_bar`, `dispatch`, `notes`, `strip_marks`); this list is the same steps
//! with the repeats left out.
//!
//! **Each part starts from a rebuilt screen** (`Verb::Fresh`): nothing of the part before is open,
//! the bar, the sheet, the layer and the strip are at rest, and the Job head's stand-in draws no ring
//! until a ring scene shows it. A step that is the part's first look at a clean screen rings
//! something that is there from the start.

